# logs origin-p ------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# origin/main's hardn -p, to a terminal or not, read, not run:$
# the config line (config.go:246, :252 or :279), the clear$
# sequence, here as the four characters \x1b, and the ~~~ line$
# even in a pipe (osdetect.go:50; utils.go:24-37), the OS line$
# (osdetect.go:93-95), then what menu/logs_print_flag.golden$
# holds of PrintLogs alone (logging.go:145-146). Colour left$
# out. The config and OS lines also go into the log$
# (logging.go:99-100), so each -p grows it by them. It needs$
# root (cmd/hardn/main.go:148), though the file is 0644.$
$
